# MAUI package

- NuGet id is `SmartImage.Maui`. Assembly/project folder stays `Maui.SmartImage`.
- Public members need XML docs. Prefer additive API; breaking changes need `breaking-change`, CHANGELOG, and a major bump.
- Remote images require `UseSmartImage()`. Do not silently no-op that contract.
- Keep cache private to this library (do not share the host `IMemoryCache` in a way that `ClearAsync` wipes the app).
- Do not commit `bin/`, `obj/`, or `artifacts/`.
